    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch11-10: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.65";
    dc:description "Distance decay and colonization histories are testable in many island systems. Attribution to Darwin's listed vectors and a universal distance cutoff remain only partly identifiable.";
