    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate successful natural colonization rates across ocean distances using island floras, dated phylogeographies, currents, bird movements, and organismal dispersal traits. Test for a steep decline after hundreds of miles and near-zero exchange between distant continents.";
